WEBVTT

00:03:28.246 --> 00:03:30.706
Tabassum evolyutsion jihatdan 
yuqumli va u odatda

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:35.150
yuzdagi boshqaruvchi 
mushaklar faoliyatini susaytiradi.

00:03:35.888 --> 00:03:39.316
Jilmayishga urinib ko’rish va uni 
tanada tuyish

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:42.976
tabassumimiz sohta yoki 
samimiy ekanligini tushunishimizga va bu

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:46.427
yordamida tabassum egasining hissiy 
holatini tushunishga yordam beradi.

00:03:47.276 --> 00:03:48.976
Taqlid borasida Fransiyaning

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.976
Klermont-Ferrand Universititetida 
yaqinda o’tkazilgan tadqiqot

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:55.976
yuzdagi tabassumga javobgar 
yuz mushaklarini susaytirish maqsadida

00:03:56.000 --> 00:04:00.349
og’zida qalam tutib tabassum sohta 
yoki samimiy ekanligini aniqlash so’raldi